**File:** `/workspaces/learn-p5/src/utils/editor/codemirror-bundle.generated.ts` (2 lines, minified single-line IIFE).

`EditorView` IS exported (good — that's why `_CM.EditorView.lineWrapping` works now), but `DecorationSet` is NOT exported anywhere:

