Searched both `src/utils/editor/` and `src/app/learn/` for `wrapCompartment`, `Compartment`, `reconfigure` — **no matches**. The word-wrap feature is the only consumer of `lineWrapping`, and it deliberately uses destroy+recreate rather than `Compartment.reconfigure(...)`. So no `reconfigure(undefined)` crash path exists; the only undefined-extension-related crash is the `DecorationSet.create` one in §3/§4. Other potential consumer: none. The toggle path is the only reconstruction trigger wired up today.

